From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shadowsangel96 <188833096+shadowsangel96@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:46:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mac: cartella del profilo e voce del Portachiavi nostre
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Senza nome proprio il browser usava ~/Library/Application Support/Chromium e la voce
"Chromium Safe Storage" del Portachiavi, cioè i dati di un Chromium già installato.
Con la voce di un'altra app macOS chiede il permesso e il cookie store resta fermo
finché qualcuno non risponde: nessuna richiesta di rete partiva.

Fork-Patch: macos/0006-cartella-del-profilo-e-voce-del-portachiavi-nostre.patch

diff --git a/chrome/app/app-Info.plist b/chrome/app/app-Info.plist
index 6fada0a2b1a1f4b5675fc657a3a7b2337e43c4a1..b3d3084e6a7648ca4010de7c79230713e038f777 100644
--- a/chrome/app/app-Info.plist
+++ b/chrome/app/app-Info.plist
@@ -157,6 +157,8 @@
 	<string>6.0</string>
 	<key>CFBundleName</key>
 	<string>${CHROMIUM_SHORT_NAME}</string>
+	<key>CrProductDirName</key>
+	<string>${CHROMIUM_SHORT_NAME}</string>
 	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
 	<string>APPL</string>
 	<key>CFBundleSignature</key>
diff --git a/components/os_crypt/common/keychain_password_mac.mm b/components/os_crypt/common/keychain_password_mac.mm
index f240dc22ee391c98c8768af7141b7447b6507cc6..2f12a692a6267f4258ee66235c385ea2a74388ff 100644
--- a/components/os_crypt/common/keychain_password_mac.mm
+++ b/components/os_crypt/common/keychain_password_mac.mm
@@ -38,8 +38,8 @@
 const char kDefaultServiceName[] = "Chrome Safe Storage";
 const char kDefaultAccountName[] = "Chrome";
 #else
-const char kDefaultServiceName[] = "Chromium Safe Storage";
-const char kDefaultAccountName[] = "Chromium";
+const char kDefaultServiceName[] = "Shannon Safe Storage";
+const char kDefaultAccountName[] = "Shannon";
 #endif
 
 // These values are persisted to logs. Entries should not be renumbered and
